@@ -0,0 +1,13 @@
+---
+id: task-005-add-rental-booking-cancellation
+type: task
+title: "Add rental booking cancellation"
+status: pending
+format: 1
+---
+
+Implemented cancellation for active rental bookings. A cancellation validates its booking ID and UTC
+timestamp, releases the reserved equipment, and returns the full booking total when it occurs at
+least 24 hours before the start (including the boundary); later cancellations return zero. Repeated
+and unknown cancellations are rejected. Added deterministic coverage for refunds, release of
+equipment, invalid input, and repeat cancellation, and updated the public README and TypeScript API.
